# Single source of truth for which Markdown markdownlint skips. All three
# callers (justfile's _lint-markdownlint, flake.nix's checks.markdownlint, and
# .pre-commit-config.yaml) now pass the same '**/*.md' glob and defer to this
# file, instead of each maintaining its own hand-listed set of paths that drift
# apart.
#
# config/ holds git submodules — separate repositories with their own linting.
# They are also absent from the Nix store copy of this flake, so linting them
# would pass locally and silently cover nothing in CI.
config/
